          "en": "which you could of course also do though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.43,
          "end": 241.59,
          "en": "But here we can loop through all the expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.59,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "in our expenses list like this",
